format 1

# age-plugin-se's CI registry (root T14): the fork CI is rendered from it
# by `actlith gen`. One gate row on the macOS runner only (D12), with an
# Xcode pinned (Swift 6.2 or newer and XCTest come from the host Xcode,
# D11, D21), running the same hk gate as the hooks (root §C).
#
# The command hands the pinned Xcode to the dev shell as
# HOST_DEVELOPER_DIR: `nix develop` overwrites DEVELOPER_DIR with the
# stdenv's apple-sdk before the shell hook runs (nix §C).

## workflows
id|kind|systems|cache|args
ci|gate|aarch64-darwin|pr0d1r2|xcode=26.6, timeout=60, command=HOST_DEVELOPER_DIR="$DEVELOPER_DIR" nix develop --command hk check --all --check

## hand-written
path|reason
.github/workflows/build.yml|upstream CI, untouched (root §C, D12): builds and tests on macOS and Linux, packages
.github/workflows/build-main.yml|upstream CI, untouched (root §C, D12): build.yml on main, then the pages deploy
.github/workflows/release.yml|upstream CI, untouched (root §C, D12): build.yml on a release, then its assets
